title: <span style="color: #00CCFF;">Bavaria</span> marches on Berlin!
new-page: true
tags: event
on-arrival: anti_coup_power = 2; bavaria_coup_power = 20; rep_bvp -= 20; soc_bvp += 20; bvp_relation -= 10; dvp_relation -= 5; rep_dnvp -= 20; rep_dvp -= 20;
view-if: bavaria_coup == 2
max-visits: 1 
priority: 5

= <span style="color: #00CCFF;">Bavaria</span> marches on Berlin!

The Bavarian Reichswehr division joined by Stahlhelm and SA starts their March on Berlin from Munich while local militias in every part of the country prepare to join their effort. We need to do something now!


- @stop_in_saxony: We will stop them right in Saxony and Thuringia!
- @wait_for_prussia: We will fight them back in Prussia!
- @give_up_outright: There is nothing we can do.

@stop_in_saxony
on-arrival: bavaria_coup_power += 2 if freiberg_bloodbath_seen; anti_coup_power += 2 if saxony_spd == 1; try_luck_in_saxony_1923 = 1

We will stop them right in Central Germany where they have to pass on their way to Berlin. As it happens those are our major strongholds.

[? if freiberg_bloodbath_seen: The Reichswehr already has a lot of troops in the region. Many of them join the coup effort since they are already bored from harrasing communists. ?]

- @1923_coup_menu: How will we stop the advance?

@wait_for_prussia
on-arrival: bavaria_coup_power += 1 if freiberg_bloodbath_seen; anti_coup_power += 2 if prussia_spd == 1; try_luck_in_prussia_1923 = 1

We will stop them in the Bullwark of Republicanism, a state with a strong comparatively loyal police and major stongholds of ours.

[? if freiberg_bloodbath_seen: Many of the Reichswehr troops stationed in Saxony join the march enthusiastically. ?]

- @1923_coup_menu: How will we stop the advance?

@1923_coup_menu

- @appeal_to_the_kpd: Call on the KPD to help us
- @appeal_to_bourgeois: Call on the Bouregois parties to help us
- @appeal_to_the_reichswehr: Call on the Reichswehr to help us
- @appeal_to_the_police_saxony: Call on the police to help us
- @appeal_to_the_police_prussia: Call on the police to help us
- @call_general_strike_central: Call for a general strike in Saxony and Thuringia
- @call_general_strike_upper: Call for a general strike in Prussian Saxony
- @coup_result: Now we can only hope for our best luck...

@appeal_to_the_kpd
view-if: 1923_kpd_option == 0
on-arrival: 1923_kpd_option = 1; anti_coup_power += 1 if kpd_relation >= 55; anti_coup_power += 1 if saxony_kpd == 1; anti_coup_power += 3 if rfb_strength_2 >= 58; bavaria_coup_power += 2 if freiberg_bloodbath_seen
go-to: 1923_coup_menu

[? if freiberg_bloodbath_seen and kpd_relation >= 55: The <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">KPD</span> is split on supporting us. Some are in favour of helping us knowing that a succesful coup would be infinetly worse for their course than everything they have wittnessed in the Republic. On the other hand the events of the last months have driven the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">KPD</span> to hate everyone. So a general strike is called against both the Republic and the Monarchists... ?]

[? if freiberg_bloodbath_seen and kpd_relation < 55: The <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">KPD</span> is firmly opposed to saving the Republic. In fact they have called a full scale insurection against everyone. The coup leaders welcome this since the The <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">KPD</span> lacks the capacity to take on either us or the them. ?]

[? if not freiberg_bloodbath_seen and kpd_relation >= 55: The <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">KPD</span> is firmly on our side! They will call a general strike and organize their militias to fight of the reactionary forces. ?]

[? if not freiberg_bloodbath_seen and kpd_relation < 55: The <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">KPD</span> is split on supporting us. Most just watch the events waiting to strike when a situation might favour their cause. ?]

[? if rfb_strength_2 >= 58: Our extensive founding of worker's militias has brought many weapons in the hands of workers who hate reactionaries. ?]


@appeal_to_bourgeois
view-if: bourgeois_support_in_1923 == 0
on-arrival: bourgeois_support_in_1923 = 1
go-to: 1923_coup_menu

The <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">DVP</span> had decided to wait things out while the <span style="color: [+ z_colour +];">Center</span> and <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">DDP</span> stand firmly behind the Republic! But... what excatly will they do now?


@appeal_to_the_reichswehr
view-if: 1923_reichswehr_option == 0
choose-if: bourgeois_support_in_1923 or reichswehr_minister_party == "SPD"
on-arrival: 1923_reichswehr_option = 1; anti_coup_power += 1 if  bourgeois_support_in_1923; anti_coup_power += 1.5 if reichswehr_minister_party == "SPD"; anti_coup_power += 2.5 if reichswehr_loyalty >= 0.31; anti_coup_power += 2.5 if reichswehr_loyalty >= 0.41; anti_coup_power += 3 if reichswehr_loyalty >= 0.54; anti_coup_power += 3 if reichswehr_loyalty >= 0.71; anti_coup_power += 5 if reichswehr_loyalty >= 0.95
go-to: 1923_coup_menu


@appeal_to_the_police_saxony
view-if: try_luck_in_saxony_1923 == 1 and 1923_police_option == 0
on-arrival: 1923_police_option = 1; anti_coup_power += 0.5 if saxony_spd == 1; anti_coup_power += 0.5 if thuringia_spd == 1; anti_coup_power += 1 if saxony_reform >= 1; anti_coup_power += 1 if thuringia_reform >= 1; anti_coup_power += 1 if spd_prussia == 1
go-to: 1923_coup_menu

[? if saxony_spd == 1: Our control over the Saxon Interior Ministry allows us to direct the local police. ?]

[? if saxony_reform >= 1: Our state reforms have secured us the loyalty of the police. ?]

[? if spd_prussia == 1: Carl Severing has sent a small support unit from Prussia to aid the cause. ?]

@appeal_to_the_police_prussia
view-if: try_luck_in_prussia_1923 == 1 and 1923_police_option == 0
on-arrival: 1923_police_option = 1; anti_coup_power += 1 if prussia_police_loyalty >= 0.41; anti_coup_power += 1 if prussia_police_loyalty >= 0.54; anti_coup_power += 1 if prussia_police_loyalty >= 0.71; anti_coup_power += 1 if prussia_police_loyalty >= 0.95; anti_coup_power += 1 if prussia_police_strength >= 100; anti_coup_power += 1 if prussia_police_strength >= 120; anti_coup_power += 2 if prussia_police_strength >= 150; anti_coup_power += 0.5 if bourgeois_support_in_1923
go-to: 1923_coup_menu

In the aftermath of the Kapp Putsch in 1920 Carl Severing started a large scale programme to increase the loyalty of the Prussian Police. Let's just hope this will be enough.

@call_general_strike_central
view-if: try_luck_in_saxony_1923 == 1 and 1923_strike_option == 0
on-arrival: 1923_strike_option = 1; anti_coup_power += 0.5 if saxony_spd = 1; anti_coup_power += 0.5 if thuringia_spd = 1; anti_coup_power += 1 if kpd_relation >= 45; anti_coup_power += 1 if kpd_relation >= 75 ; anti_coup_power += 1 if uspd_joined > 2; anti_coup_power += 1 if (not uspd_joined and uspd_relation >= 30); anti_coup_power += 0.5 if uspd_relation >= 45; anti_coup_power += 0.5 if saxony_kpd == 1
go-to: 1923_coup_menu

We have called a general strike in Saxony and Thuringia.

@call_general_strike_upper
view-if: try_luck_in_prussia_1923 == 1 and 1923_strike_option == 0
on-arrival: 1923_strike_option = 1; anti_coup_power += 1; anti_coup_power += 1 if kpd_relation >= 45; anti_coup_power += 1 if kpd_relation >= 75 ; anti_coup_power += 1 if uspd_joined > 2; anti_coup_power += 1 if (not uspd_joined and uspd_relation >= 30); anti_coup_power += 0.5 if uspd_relation >= 45; anti_coup_power += 0.1 if spd_prussia == 1
go-to: 1923_coup_menu

We have called a general strike in the Prussian province of Saxony and other industrial regions of Prussia.


@give_up_outright
go-to: total_defeat

@coup_result
go-to: total_defeat if anti_coup_power < bavaria_coup_power; truce if anti_coup_power == bavaria_coup_power; easy_win if anti_coup_power > bavaria_coup_power


@total_defeat
on-arrival: president = "vacant"; president_party = "I"
title: Total defeat
go-to: the_kaiser_state

The reactionary forces march through our strongholds where any resistance is torn apart. Berlin is taken within a day. Ebert resigns.


@truce
title: What is that?


@easy_win
title: Victory for the Republic!







